    "All of its margin is in use, and Perpl liquidates at 100%%. Mark %@, liquidation %@. %@" : {
      "comment" : "A margin alert when all of a position's margin is in use. The values: the mark price, the liquidation price, then what to do, a sentence of its own.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "All of its margin is in use, and Perpl liquidates at 100%%. Mark %1$@, liquidation %2$@. %3$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todo su margen está en uso, y Perpl liquida al 100%%. Precio de marca %1$@, liquidación %2$@. %3$@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toute sa marge est utilisée, et Perpl liquide à 100%%. Prix de marque %1$@, liquidation %2$@. %3$@"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "증거금이 모두 사용 중이며, Perpl은 100%%에서 청산합니다. 마크 가격 %1$@, 청산 가격 %2$@. %3$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该仓位的保证金已全部占用，Perpl 会在 100%% 时强平。标记价格 %1$@，强平价格 %2$@。%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All of its margin is in use. Mark %@, liquidation %@. %@" : {
