    "Another request went out first, so this one wasn't sent. Nothing was placed. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "An order sheet's error: the app refused to send an order because another Perps request had just gone out with a later request number; nothing left the device.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otra solicitud salió antes, así que esta no se envió. No se colocó nada. Vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une autre demande est partie en premier : celle-ci n'a donc pas été envoyée. Rien n'a été placé. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다른 요청이 먼저 전송되어 이 요청은 전송되지 않았습니다. 아무것도 접수되지 않았습니다. 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "另一个请求先发出，因此此请求未发送。未挂出任何订单。重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
