    "Filling it would carry more unrealized loss than this order allows." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ejecutarla supondría más pérdida no realizada de la que permite esta orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'exécuter entraînerait une perte latente supérieure à ce que cet ordre autorise."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "체결되면 이 주문이 허용하는 것보다 큰 미실현 손실이 발생합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成交后的未实现亏损会超过此订单允许的上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From retired launchpads: sell them on their page. They can't be bought, and a coin waiting to graduate can't be sold until it does." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
