    "If your passkey is in iCloud Keychain, Passwords may keep it in Deleted for up to 30 days." : {
      "comment" : "Passwords is iOS's Passwords app and Deleted its list of deleted passwords and passkeys (iOS 18 and later): use iOS's own names for them in this language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tu llave de acceso está en el Llavero de iCloud, la app Contraseñas puede conservarla hasta 30 días en su sección de elementos eliminados."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si votre clé d'accès se trouve dans le trousseau iCloud, l'app Mots de passe peut la conserver jusqu'à 30 jours dans « Supprimés »."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "패스키가 iCloud 키체인에 있다면 ‘암호’ 앱이 최대 30일 동안 ‘삭제됨’에 보관할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
