            "value" : "Perpl 未能及时执行该订单，因此未挂出任何订单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perpl couldn't post it to the order book." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names. 'It' is the order.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl no pudo publicarla en el libro de órdenes."
