    },
    "Perpl couldn't settle it." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names. 'It' is the order; to settle: to record the trade on Perpl's exchange.",
      "localizations" : {
