        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl 未执行该订单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perpl didn't take this order because it clashed with another one from your account. Nothing was placed. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl no aceptó esta orden porque entró en conflicto con otra de tu cuenta. No se colocó nada. Vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl n'a pas pris cet ordre, car il est entré en conflit avec un autre ordre de votre compte. Rien n'a été placé. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 주문이 계정의 다른 주문과 충돌하여 Perpl이 받지 않았습니다. 아무것도 접수되지 않았습니다. 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl 未接受此订单，因为它与你账户中的另一笔订单冲突。未挂出任何订单。重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perpl dropped the trading connection because the app fell behind reading it. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl cortó la conexión de trading porque la app se quedó atrás al leerla. Vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl a coupé la connexion de trading, car l'app avait pris du retard dans sa lecture. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱이 데이터를 제때 읽지 못해 Perpl이 거래 연결을 끊었습니다. 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
