            "value" : "Perpl 拒绝了该订单的有效期限。重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perpl refused the take-profit or stop-loss (its price, size or position)." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl rechazó el take profit o el stop loss (su precio, tamaño o posición)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl a refusé le take profit ou le stop loss (son prix, sa taille ou sa position)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl이 익절 또는 손절 주문을 거부했습니다(가격, 수량 또는 포지션 문제)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
