    },
    "Settling at this price would leave the market insolvent, so Perpl refused it." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registrar la operación a este precio dejaría el mercado insolvente, así que Perpl rechazó la orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Régler l'opération à ce prix rendrait le marché insolvable : Perpl a donc refusé l'ordre."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 가격으로 정산하면 마켓이 지급 불능 상태가 되므로 Perpl이 주문을 거부했습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按此价格结算会导致该市场资不抵债，因此 Perpl 拒绝了该订单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Short %@" : {
