    "The connection to Perpl dropped before it reported the close's result. Your positions are reloading: check them before closing again." : {
      "comment" : "The result of a Perps close the app sent, under 'Result not confirmed yet' in the close sheet and the trade screen's status row: the trading connection closed before Perpl reported the close's result.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La conexión con Perpl se cortó antes de que informara del resultado del cierre. Tus posiciones se están recargando: revísalas antes de volver a cerrar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La connexion à Perpl a été coupée avant qu'il n'indique le résultat de la clôture. Vos positions se rechargent : vérifiez-les avant de clôturer à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl이 종료 결과를 알리기 전에 연결이 끊어졌습니다. 포지션을 다시 불러오는 중입니다. 다시 종료하기 전에 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与 Perpl 的连接在其报告平仓结果前断开。正在重新加载你的仓位：再次平仓前先查看它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to Perpl dropped before it reported the result. Your positions and orders are reloading: check them before placing it again." : {
      "comment" : "The result of a Perps order the app sent, under 'Result not confirmed yet' in the order sheet and the trade screen's status row: the trading connection closed before Perpl reported the result.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La conexión con Perpl se cortó antes de que informara del resultado. Tus posiciones y órdenes se están recargando: revísalas antes de volver a colocarla."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La connexion à Perpl a été coupée avant qu'il n'indique le résultat. Vos positions et ordres se rechargent : vérifiez-les avant de le placer à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl이 결과를 알리기 전에 연결이 끊어졌습니다. 포지션과 주문을 다시 불러오는 중입니다. 다시 넣기 전에 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与 Perpl 的连接在其报告结果前断开。正在重新加载你的仓位和委托：再次下单前先查看它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The contract rejected the transaction (custom error %@ with %@)." : {
