          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This close is larger than your open position, so Perpl refused it." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names. A close: an order that reduces or closes a position.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este cierre es mayor que tu posición abierta, así que Perpl lo rechazó."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette clôture dépasse votre position ouverte : Perpl l'a donc refusée."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 종료 주문이 보유 포지션보다 커서 Perpl이 거부했습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此平仓数量大于你的持仓，因此 Perpl 拒绝了该订单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coin is migrating from its bonding curve to its pool: it can't be traded until it graduates, and then it trades on Swap. Its launch couldn't be read just now; its page will try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta moneda está migrando de su curva de bonding a su pool: no se puede operar hasta que se gradúe, y luego se opera en Intercambio. No se pudo leer su lanzamiento en este momento; su página lo volverá a intentar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce jeton migre de sa bonding curve vers son pool : il ne peut pas être échangé avant sa graduation, puis il s'échangera sur l'écran Échange. Son lancement n'a pas pu être lu pour le moment ; sa page réessaiera."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 코인은 본딩 커브에서 풀로 마이그레이션 중입니다. 졸업할 때까지 거래할 수 없으며, 졸업 후에는 스왑에서 거래됩니다. 지금은 런칭 정보를 읽지 못했으며, 해당 페이지에서 다시 시도합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此币正在从联合曲线迁移到池子：毕业前无法交易，毕业后将在兑换中交易。暂时无法读取它的发射信息；其页面会再次尝试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This coin is still on its launchpad's bonding curve, which Swap can't route: buy and sell it on its Launch page. Once it graduates, it trades on Swap." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta moneda sigue en la curva de bonding de su launchpad, que Intercambio no puede enrutar: cómprala y véndela en su página de lanzamiento. Cuando se gradúe, se operará en Intercambio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce jeton est encore sur la bonding curve de son launchpad, que l'écran Échange ne peut pas router : achetez-le et vendez-le sur sa page de lancement. Une fois gradué, il s'échange sur l'écran Échange."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
