            "value" : "此市场目前暂停交易。稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This market's order book is full. Try again later." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El libro de órdenes de este mercado está lleno. Vuelve a intentarlo más tarde."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le carnet d'ordres de ce marché est plein. Réessayez plus tard."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 마켓의 호가창이 가득 찼습니다. 나중에 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此市场的订单簿已满。稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This name has hidden or direction-changing characters. Remove them." : {
