    "Your Perpl account has the most API keys it allows (16). Remove keys you no longer use under API Keys on app.perpl.xyz, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu cuenta de Perpl tiene el máximo de claves API que permite (16). Quita las claves que ya no uses en API Keys de app.perpl.xyz y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre compte Perpl a atteint le nombre maximal de clés API autorisé (16). Supprimez les clés que vous n'utilisez plus dans API Keys sur app.perpl.xyz, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl 계정의 API 키가 허용 최대치(16개)에 도달했습니다. app.perpl.xyz의 API Keys에서 더 이상 사용하지 않는 키를 제거한 후 다시 시도하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Perpl 账户的 API 密钥已达上限（16 个）。在 app.perpl.xyz 的 API Keys 中移除不再使用的密钥，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Perpl account is frozen, so it can't trade right now. Contact Perpl for help." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu cuenta de Perpl está congelada, así que no puede operar ahora mismo. Contacta con Perpl para obtener ayuda."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre compte Perpl est gelé et ne peut pas trader pour le moment. Contactez Perpl pour obtenir de l'aide."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl 계정이 동결되어 지금은 거래할 수 없습니다. Perpl에 도움을 요청하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Perpl 账户已被冻结，目前无法交易。联系 Perpl 获取帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your account has the most open orders Perpl allows. Cancel some first." : {
      "comment" : "Why Perpl refused or ended a Perps order or request, as one or two whole sentences. Shown on its own under a result headline ('Not filled', 'Order failed') and as the last placeholder of the take-profit / stop-loss and cancel result lines ('Take-profit not placed: %@'). Perpl and Monad are names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu cuenta tiene el máximo de órdenes abiertas que permite Perpl. Cancela algunas primero."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre compte a atteint le nombre maximal d'ordres ouverts autorisé par Perpl. Annulez-en d'abord quelques-uns."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "계정의 미체결 주문 수가 Perpl 허용 한도에 도달했습니다. 먼저 일부를 취소하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
